OL,3,GNEWSABoys arrested after failing to
OL,4,Astop and bike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers have been arrested
OL,7,Ffollowing a collision involving a
OL,8,Fmotorcycle and a car.
OL,10,FThe crash happened at the junction of
OL,11,FMoorside Road and Harrogate Road in
OL,12,FBradford at about 15:45 BST on
OL,13,FWednesday and left one boy with a
OL,14,Fserious leg injury and the other with
OL,15,Fminor injuries, West Yorkshire Police
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FPolice said the motorcycle had been
OL,19,Fsighted by officers just prior to the
OL,20,Fcollision and had failed to stop.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
